        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: And all of them knew that whatever we wrote still had to survive ratification.
          I had no choice but to compromise.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 3
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
