        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Perhaps a just constitution can only emerge from people who disagree
          and still have to leave the room with one government.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
