      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: True, but who is the better judge? Judgment is not free from passion
          or prejudice. An ambitious man may appeal to fear, hope, or resentment
          to deceive the people.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
