      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: In a direct election, the large states possess more influence because
          they contain more voters, allowing them to decide the presidency through
          sheer numbers.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
